ix.net/e83e8e8e/uploads/origins/5ec3032a-98f9-4f8a-8f15-974ae92829f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=64adcb580b8275c3b43442a5ffa1d2e3 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Nice to speak to you again, sensei!! I continue to cherish my previous requests!! I am still using them as my desktop lock screen and wallpaper. ^^ May I request another illustration? The character is a fortune teller who uses magical tarot cards. A gentle and feminine man. The theme is space, stars, and the universe. You may interpret the theme however you like.\n\nPlease draw either of the outfits as you prefer. \n\nIf wish to draw him wearing his mask, please draw the mask on another layer that can be turned on and off.\n\nIf any of his joints are visible, there is a secret... he is a doll-like man in an artificial body. His joints look like a ball-jointed doll. That is why his clothing usually hides his joints.\n\nThank you for considering my request!! (I'm very sorry if the machine translation is rude at all.)\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/voheYIy", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@xxzaco_box/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/86cf92bd/uploads/origins/dff0f4b2-da16-411a-afaf-864517ec9ba0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b489a6751d6e50e9d5c0ae0f228cad52", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/86cf92bd/uploads/origins/dff0f4b2-da16-411a-afaf-864517ec9ba0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b489a6751d6e50e9d5c0ae0f228cad52, https://si.imgix.net/86cf92bd/uploads/origins/dff0f4b2-da16-411a-afaf-864517ec9ba0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=78b38a3dc14922e7a3ba827d02d19ee7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/86cf92bd/uploads/origins/dff0f4b2-da16-411a-afaf-864517ec9ba0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c9b83a5ddfdcf5cad2a2b69fe5ff2f22 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！私はあなたの描く男性がとても好きです、私のOCの絵をあなたに任せたいと思います！\n\nヒドラ：30～35歳。セクシーでエレガントなタイプで、細身で中性的な外見、時々ちょっとツンデレ。アイシャドウは濃いめ。バレてもいいんです。\n\n王様のように誇り高く、セクシーな彼を描けることを願っています！\n\nご覧いただきありがとうございます！このリクエストに何か不適切なものを感じたら、遠慮なくキャンセルしてください、ありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1bmK7ecQTDrFczJfZdUmR17T9QbE1nJGq?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@xxzaco_box/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/35a7385b/uploads/origins/87045be6-97bc-43c7-9c57-5f7d28a969c7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e67dfa9a367b0b3ec87bcb3250c3418e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/35a7385b/uploads/origins/87045be6-97bc-43c7-9c57-5f7d28a969c7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e67dfa9a367b0b3ec87bcb3250c3418e, https://si.imgix.net/35a7385b/uploads/origins/87045be6-97bc-43c7-9c57-5f7d28a969c7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4e90422cbf9048e1104be0b0fbf09fdc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/35a7385b/uploads/origins/87045be6-97bc-43c7-9c57-5f7d28a969c7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1a554935cdce1253d4d969d8a6705fc9 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello again, sensei!! I remain enchanted by your previous work!! It was a gift for my husband, who has used it as his desktop wallpaper for 10 months!!! I would like to request another illustration of the same character, if possible. It is again a gift for my husband.\n\nThe character is a gentle and kind fairy prince with a mysterious nature.\n\nPossible themes: White chrysanthemums, blue morpho butterflies, royalty. If it is helpful, here is some visual inspiration, but please do not feel constrained by it: https://br.pinterest.com/languhiris/adonia-aes/\n\nFeel free to choose composition and themes freely. I would like a different composition than the previous request for the sake of variety. I am very excited to see what